### Describe your issue.

When using the workers keyword argument in integrate.quad_vec, a fatal error occurs and the threads are not properly closed, resulting in an infinite loop of overlapping tracebacks.

Part of the error is below, although multiple tracebacks end up overlapping one another so I am unsure if it was completely finished where I cut it off. Happy to run it again if necessary and provide more of the output

